  "description": "Club de Nuit Precieux I by Armaf is a refined, elegant, woody-amber fragrance designed as a premium, upscale evolution of the Club de Nuit DNA. It opens with bright citrus freshness, smooth fruity nuances, and refined aromatic sparkle, delivering a polished and luxurious first impression. The heart introduces soft florals, subtle spices, and clean woods, adding depth while maintaining a smooth, modern masculine profile. The base settles into amber, musk, patchouli, and warm woods, creating a long-lasting, sophisticated trail that feels elegant, clean, and confident. This fragrance is ideal for customers who want a more luxurious, smoother, less aggressive Club de Nuit experience with a classy, premium feel.",
